givees all files permission,
drwxr-xr-x 5 animesh animesh 4096 Oct 30 08:06 tempf

d: Indicates it's a directory. (Files would have - here.)

rwxr-xr-x: Permissions:
rwx (owner) - read, write, execute.
r-x (group) - read, execute only.
r-x (others) - read, execute only.
5: Number of hard links to the directory.
animesh animesh: The owner and group of the file/directory.
4096: File size in bytes.
Oct 30 08:06: Last modification date and time.
tempf: Name of the file/directory.
